                      (    forth6809.asm):03327         
E0D9                  (    forth6809.asm):03328         TNDOUBLE:                           ; U currently holds [UDLO(bottom), UDHI(top)], matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):03329                                             ; ANS's (ud1) stack order directly.
E0D9 DC00             (    forth6809.asm):03330                     LDD   STATE
E0DB 27B1             (    forth6809.asm):03331                     BEQ   ILOOP             ; interpreting: already correctly placed,
