E244 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03578         SWPUSH:     PSHU  D
E246 39               (    forth6809.asm):03579                     RTS
E247 CC0000           (    forth6809.asm):03580         SWNOT:      LDD   #0
E24A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03581                     PSHU  D
E24C 39               (    forth6809.asm):03582                     RTS
