F352 EC02             (    forth6809.asm):07006                     LDD   2,X
F354 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07007                     PSHU  D
F356 EC84             (    forth6809.asm):07008                     LDD   ,X
F358 3606             (    forth6809.asm):07009                     PSHU  D
